  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, bring the water to the boil. Add basmati rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 10 mins, then remove pan from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/605157c81d78e81370706f75/step-c33502b3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop or crush garlic. Grate ginger (unpeeled). Thinly slice carrot (unpeeled) into half-moons. Trim and halve green beans.\n• Cut Malaysian tofu into 1cm cubes. In a medium bowl, combine tofu, 1/2 the Malaysian spice blend and a drizzle of olive oil. Season with salt and pepper and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/605157c81d78e81370706f75/step-21c53ece.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat. Cook tofu, turning, until browned, 3-4 mins. Transfer to a bowl.\n• Return pan to medium-high heat. Add carrot, beans and a dash of water. Stir-fry until softened, 3-4 mins. Stir in garlic, ginger and remaining spice with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook until fragrant, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/605157c81d78e81370706f75/step-ca3ea51b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return tofu to pan. Add coconut milk, soy sauce and brown sugar and stir until well combined.\n• Simmer until reduced slightly, 2-3 mins. Season to taste.\n• Divide rice between bowls and top with tofu curry.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/605157c81d78e81370706f75/step-000470d7.jpg"
    }
  ]
